<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN RESULTS. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN RESULTS. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Rainer Schuttler (Germany) beat 2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-6, retired.</p>
<p>7-Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>4-Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Susheel Narla (India) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>5-Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>3-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Oleg Ogorodov (Uzbekistan) 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-1 (corrects winner).</p>
</text>
